  "name": "Chicken Pasta Bake",
  "subtitle": "A creamy tomato bake with chicken, bacon, peppers, and two cheeses.",
  "description": "Chicken, vegetables, and pasta simmer in a smoky tomato sauce enriched with mascarpone, then bake beneath a cheddar and mozzarella topping.",
